&lt;li&gt;Develop and prototype ML models to solve complex business challenges using modern techniques and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with engineers, domain experts, and business teams to translate requirements into deliverables, using approved AI tools where appropriate to improve efficiency and accelerate insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and coach data science pods, supporting skill development and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert on ML architecture, model calibration, and productionisation, promoting responsible AI practices and scalable model governance where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and deploying data science solutions in Python and related ML libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in applied machine learning, model development, and data engineering, with an appreciation of responsible AI principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud environments (Azure, AWS, GCP) and tools such as Spark, Hive, and Redshift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead cross-functional teams and mentor junior practitioners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate complex technical concepts clearly to non-technical audiences and apply AI-enabled approaches to deliver practical business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in Kaggle or other data science competitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MLOps practices (CI/CD, model monitoring, DevOps integration).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with advanced NLP frameworks such as spaCy or Transformers and exposure to AI technologies including Generative AI or LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc or PhD in a numerate discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial services or banking experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
